      },
      {
        "version": "C",
        "parts": "No activation ablation or analysis of deletion versus blocked access."
      },
      {
        "version": "D",
        "parts": "No quantization."
      },
      {
        "version": "E",
        "parts": "No prompting-only attack."
      },
      {
        "version": "F",
        "parts": "No robust counter-method. The noisy-update and unrelated-data defenses target the checkpoint-differencing attack, not the claim's attacks."
      }
    ],
    "missing": [],
    "verdict_notes": "The reader's 'tests/T2' and its limits_scope label on A are rejected. The extraction rows' 'reversed' states mislabel improvements over a reference model. All rows used the invalid version id V1. The post-unlearning rows show near-zero extraction, consistent with genuine removal under exact retraining. WMDP here is the bio-retain corpus used as fine-tuning text, not the hazardous-knowledge MCQ."
  },
